    "detailed_description": "Welcome to Stack Surge, the delightful <strong>3D physics </strong>block stacking <strong>puzzle game</strong><br>that combines <strong>vibrant </strong>aesthetics with <strong>relaxing </strong>gameplay. Play alone or battle<br>your friends in <strong>multiplayer</strong>.<br><br>Enjoy <strong>3 </strong>exciting modes in <strong>27 </strong>thrilling singleplayer levels or multiplayer battles.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/01f1eb3e99a2c34f8af6cf51294e31a5.avif?t=1721213627\" width=360 height=132 /></span><br>Experience the <strong>ultimate </strong>test of strategy and creativity in our <strong>4-player versus</strong> mode, where<br>you can build, destroy, and outsmart your friends in any of the 3 modes.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/12c37d83766702bc07114f1b1ba620b5.poster.avif?t=1721213627\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/12c37d83766702bc07114f1b1ba620b5.webm?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/12c37d83766702bc07114f1b1ba620b5.mp4?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/c3bdb1f0ca87db7c2523d5944e1bd627.avif?t=1721213627\" width=360 height=132 /></span><br>Build <strong>strong </strong>and <strong>fast </strong>in this thrilling chase against the storm! Collect powerups<br>to assist you and reach high goals.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/880c4da2631b32bedfddbfbd25aaad96.poster.avif?t=1721213627\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/880c4da2631b32bedfddbfbd25aaad96.webm?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/880c4da2631b32bedfddbfbd25aaad96.mp4?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/15c27cc7e8de475364ce014e0d900132.avif?t=1721213627\" width=360 height=132 /></span><br>Think <strong>strategically </strong>and insert blocks <strong>carefully </strong>in this satisfying brain teaser.<br>Take your time and fill out as much as you can!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/36cc7fbb0d3bb9eeda4c241a0c89d2e2.poster.avif?t=1721213627\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/36cc7fbb0d3bb9eeda4c241a0c89d2e2.webm?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/36cc7fbb0d3bb9eeda4c241a0c89d2e2.mp4?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/cf17424d87bb63a660ec9ba4f9b8fbc8.avif?t=1721213627\" width=360 height=132 /></span><br>This one's about playing <strong>cautiously </strong>but <strong>fast</strong>! Wrap the gold blocks quickly<br>before time runs out.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/0e2c50c739fda3c9662fd911a3f2bfa8.poster.avif?t=1721213627\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/0e2c50c739fda3c9662fd911a3f2bfa8.webm?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/0e2c50c739fda3c9662fd911a3f2bfa8.mp4?t=1721213627\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/9db7eea3b3e52319649a1105b0177cab.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Sticks to every block it touches.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/1ce952a8f1b7e2dd5c4725b49afaefea.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Freezes in place to create building area.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/28c7c1ed408443df910299664a290d7d.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Explodes after a short delay.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/3f7843c4be57cc6d3eded548bd065ddb.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Has a slippery surface.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/4b63416a7bddceefd08767dcdf757272.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Attracts all nearby blocks.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2889310/extras/c2bb41caf5cd5d2664c4f6cf5d4ebf4d.webp?t=1721213627\" width=26 height=26 /></span> Br